Model: opus-mt-en-zh
Publisher: Language Technology Research Group at the University of Helsinki (Helsinki-NLP)
Source: https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-zh
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Training data: OPUS (https://opus.nlpl.eu/), cited by the model card.

This image does not ship the original PyTorch checkpoint. The image build
converts it to CTranslate2 float32, the same weights in that runtime.
Runtime: CTranslate2 (MIT) and SentencePiece (Apache-2.0).
The published checkpoint repeats itself on the bare word "hello". The sidecar
keeps a single copy of a hypothesis that is one token repeated, and otherwise
returns the beam-4 string unchanged.

Attribution when the translation feature is offered: "English-to-Chinese
translation uses Helsinki-NLP opus-mt-en-zh (CC-BY-4.0)."

The process translates locally. It does not call Bailian, Google, Apple, or
Telegram, and it has no fallback to those services.
